unded UP to SGD 3.15, inside the SGD 15.00 cap. This matches your own statement that you drove 13.8 km while the receipt showed 9.6 km. Points that did not change the result: the rider is right that no traffic advisory is available - EV-ADVIS-00109-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0 and POL-RD-03 exonerates nothing - but the exoneration here rests on the rider's own instruction, not on any traffic cause, so that point does not revive the refund. The POL-RD-06 repeat-deviation check does not fire either way: driver_profile.deviation_flags_90d is 0 against 511 completed trips in 90 days, so there is no FULL_REFUND uplift and no driver-conduct referral. Figures used: charged_total 21.32; recomputed optimal-route fare 13.32; distance refund to the rider 0.00; driver compensation 3.15. The monetary effect of SGD 3.15 is below the SGD 8.00 execution threshold, so this executes automatically."
