tform-funded and the rider's charge is not increased. The POL-RD-06 driver-profile check was run because the deviation was material: EV-DPROF-00109 shows deviation_flags_90d of 0 against 511 completed trips in 90 days, so no repeat-deviation pattern is established, no FULL_REFUND uplift applies and no driver-conduct referral is made. No other clause produces a referral. Confidence is 0.90: every artifact carrying the deciding facts — the chat log, the GPS trace, the trip record and the fare breakdown — sits at weight 1.0, so the POL-GEN-02(2) cap is 1.0. The monetary effect, 3.15, is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of 8.00, so this ruling executes automatically on issue, and either party may appeal under POL-GEN-04."
